   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "kind": "block",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "One row per source. Unchecking takes it out of the **next** run.\n\nWhat the checklist does not say: the five rows are not equivalent. One of them is not fetched at all, one of them is ours, and one of them costs two scorers."
   },
