   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "checked": false,
    "kind": "checkbox",
    "parent": "panel-sources",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**Off by default, not removed.** Settled Aug 2026: mostly noise outside Fed weeks, kept as a config option in case a Fed week wants it back. It is the only unticked box on this list, and this checkbox is now the only place in the whole product where the Macro Calendar appears.\n\n**Parked, not answered:** it is also the only input that never passes a confidence gate — it bypasses enrichment, so the 0.70 threshold cannot touch it. Rebuilding it as a scored signal would give 'noisy' a dial instead of a switch. Not this quarter."
   },
