   ],
   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "kind": "block",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**Two different animals in one panel.**\n\nThe four small buttons re-score a single pass and leave the other three as they were — so the run's Signals end up from two different moments, and its settings snapshot describes a whole day when it only describes a quarter. Confirmed as an accident of how it was built, not a design.\n\nThe big button does a whole day properly.\n\nThey sit at the same size, in the same panel, four rows apart."
   },
   "fillStyle": "solid",
